<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2058] Reduce test matrix on Travis</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2058</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We have 11 profile in the Travis matrix and tests are running for a long time. We should consider streamlining it:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;do we really support that many versions of Spark? how about just 1.6.x, 2.0.x and 2.1.x?&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;could we merge the python 2 and 3 tests into other profiles?&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;could we merge the Livy test into another profile?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
